# ThousandEyes MCP Lab

- Static single-page site in `site/` (generated from `src/shell.html` by `python3 src/build.py`), scoreboard API in `api/` (AWS SAM, Python 3.12 Lambda, DynamoDB), hosting in `infra/` (S3 + CloudFront, optional custom domain), one-shot deploy in `scripts/deploy.sh`.
- Full map, rules and verification steps: `AGENTS.md`. Deployment runbook: `DEPLOY.md`. The owner's task for you: `CURSOR_PROMPT.md`.

## Hard rules

- Never commit secrets. `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` goes in as an env var to `scripts/deploy.sh`; `samconfig.toml` stays git-ignored.
- Answers live only in `api/checkpoints.json` and in DynamoDB-side checks; the page carries SHA-256 hashes. Never copy answers into `site/` or `src/shell.html`.
- `canon()` in `api/app.py` and in `src/shell.html` must stay byte-for-byte equivalent in behaviour.
- `site/index.html` is generated: edit the source and rebuild, commit both.
- Cisco dark brand: Midnight `#07182D`, white text, Cisco Blue `#02C8FF` headings, Medium Blue `#0A60FF` outlines, Magenta `#FF007F` and Orange `#FF9000` decorative only, outlined containers, no fills. No em dashes in any text. Australian spelling.
- Ask before: changing the domain, enabling the front desk (`/ask`), changing questions or scoring, deleting stacks.

## Deploy in one line

`AWS_REGION=ap-southeast-2 scripts/deploy.sh` (add `DOMAIN`, `CERT_ARN`, `HOSTED_ZONE_ID`, `EVENT_NAME`, `EVENT_DATE`, `EVENT_CITY`, `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` as needed), then `scripts/smoke.sh`.
